{"suttaId":"thi-ap19","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[8090,8340],"vripara":"384"},"segments":{"thi-ap19:0.3":"Uppalavaṇṇātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap19:1.1":"“Bhikkhunī uppalavaṇṇā, iddhiyā pāramiṃ gatā;","thi-ap19:1.3":"Vanditvā satthuno pāde, idaṃ vacanamabravi.","thi-ap19:2.1":"“‘Nitthiṇṇā jātisaṃsāraṃ [jātisaṃsārā (pī.)], pattāhaṃ acalaṃ padaṃ;","thi-ap19:2.3":"Sabbadukkhaṃ mayā khīṇaṃ, ārocemi mahāmuni.","thi-ap19:3.1":"“‘Yāvatā parisā atthi, pasannā jinasāsane;","thi-ap19:3.3":"Yassā ca meparādhotthi, khamantu jinasammukhā.","thi-ap19:4.1":"“‘Saṃsāre saṃsarantiyā [saṃsarantā me (syā.)], khalitaṃ me sace bhave;","thi-ap19:4.3":"Ārocemi mahāvīra, aparādhaṃ khamassu taṃ [me (syā.)].","thi-ap19:5.1":"“‘Iddhiñcāpi nidassehi, mama sāsanakārike;","thi-ap19:5.3":"Catasso parisā ajja, kaṅkhaṃ chindāhi yāvatā.","thi-ap19:6.1":"“‘Dhītā tuyhaṃ mahāvīra, paññavanta jutindhara;","thi-ap19:6.3":"Bahuñca dukkaraṃ kammaṃ, kataṃ me atidukkaraṃ.","thi-ap19:7.1":"“‘Uppalasseva me vaṇṇo, nāmenuppalanāmikā;","thi-ap19:7.3":"Sāvikā te mahāvīra, pāde vandāmi cakkhuma.","thi-ap19:8.1":"“‘Rāhulo ca ahañceva, nekajātisate bahū;","thi-ap19:8.3":"Ekasmiṃ sambhave jātā, samānachandamānasā.","thi-ap19:9.1":"“‘Nibbatti ekato hoti, jātiyāpi ca ekato [jātīsu bahuso mama (sī.)];","thi-ap19:9.3":"Pacchime bhave sampatte, ubhopi nānāsambhavā.","thi-ap19:10.1":"“‘Putto ca rāhulo nāma, dhītā uppalasavhayā;","thi-ap19:10.3":"Passa vīra mamaṃ iddhiṃ, balaṃ dassemi satthuno.","thi-ap19:11.1":"“‘Mahāsamudde caturo, pakkhipi hatthapātiyaṃ;","thi-ap19:11.3":"Telaṃ hatthagatañceva, khiḍḍo [vejjo (sī. pī.)] komārako yathā.","thi-ap19:12.1":"“‘Ubbattayitvā pathaviṃ, pakkhipi hatthapātiyaṃ;","thi-ap19:12.3":"Cittaṃ muñjaṃ yathā nāma, luñci komārako yuvā.","thi-ap19:13.1":"“‘Cakkavāḷasamaṃ pāṇiṃ, chādayitvāna matthake;","thi-ap19:13.3":"Vassāpetvāna phusitaṃ, nānāvaṇṇaṃ punappunaṃ.","thi-ap19:14.1":"“‘Bhūmiṃ udukkhalaṃ katvā, dhaññaṃ katvāna sakkharaṃ;","thi-ap19:14.3":"Sineruṃ musalaṃ katvā, maddi komārikā yathā.","thi-ap19:15.1":"“‘Dhītāhaṃ buddhaseṭṭhassa, nāmenuppalasavhayā;","thi-ap19:15.3":"Abhiññāsu vasībhūtā, tava sāsanakārikā.","thi-ap19:16.1":"“‘Nānāvikubbanaṃ katvā, dassetvā lokanāyakaṃ;","thi-ap19:16.3":"Nāmagottañca sāvetvā [pakāsetvā (syā.)], pāde vandāmi cakkhuma.","thi-ap19:17.1":"“‘Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap19:17.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī homi mahāmune.","thi-ap19:18.1":"“‘Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap19:18.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap19:19.1":"“‘Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap19:19.3":"Ñāṇaṃ me vimalaṃ [vipulaṃ (syā.)] suddhaṃ, sabhāvena mahesino.","thi-ap19:20.1":"“‘Purimānaṃ jinaggānaṃ, saṅgamaṃ te nidassitaṃ [sammukhā ca parammukhā (sī.)];","thi-ap19:20.3":"Adhikāraṃ bahuṃ mayhaṃ, tuyhatthāya mahāmuni.","thi-ap19:21.1":"“‘Yaṃ mayā pūritaṃ kammaṃ, kusalaṃ sara me muni;","thi-ap19:21.3":"Tavatthāya mahāvīra, puññaṃ upacitaṃ mayā.","thi-ap19:22.1":"“‘Abhabbaṭṭhāne vajjetvā, vārayantī [parivajjanti (sī.), paripācento (syā.)] anācaraṃ;","thi-ap19:22.3":"Tavatthāya mahāvīra, cattaṃ me jīvituttamaṃ.","thi-ap19:23.1":"“‘Dasakoṭisahassāni, adāsiṃ mama jīvitaṃ;","thi-ap19:23.3":"Pariccattā ca me homi, tavatthāya mahāmuni.","thi-ap19:24.1":"“‘Tadātivimhitā sabbā, sirasāva katañjalī;","thi-ap19:24.3":"Avocayye kathaṃ āsi, atuliddhiparakkamā’.","thi-ap19:25.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, nāgakaññā ahaṃ tadā;","thi-ap19:25.3":"Vimalā nāma nāmena, kaññānaṃ sādhusammatā.","thi-ap19:26.1":"“Mahorago mahānāgo, pasanno jinasāsane;","thi-ap19:26.3":"Padumuttaraṃ mahātejaṃ, nimantesi sasāvakaṃ.","thi-ap19:27.1":"“Ratanamayaṃ maṇḍapaṃ, pallaṅkaṃ ratanāmayaṃ;","thi-ap19:27.3":"Ratanaṃ vālukākiṇṇaṃ, upabhogaṃ ratanāmayaṃ.","thi-ap19:28.1":"“Maggañca paṭiyādesi, ratanaddhajabhūsitaṃ;","thi-ap19:28.3":"Paccuggantvāna sambuddhaṃ, vajjanto tūriyehi so.","thi-ap19:29.1":"“Parisāhi ca catūhi [parisāhi catūhi so (sī.), parisāhi catasso hi (pī.)], parivuto [sahito (sī.), pharate (syā.), pareto (pī.)] lokanāyako;","thi-ap19:29.3":"Mahoragassa bhavane, nisīdi paramāsane.","thi-ap19:30.1":"“Annaṃ pānaṃ khādanīyaṃ, bhojanañca mahārahaṃ;","thi-ap19:30.3":"Varaṃ varañca pādāsi, nāgarājā mahāyasaṃ.","thi-ap19:31.1":"“Bhuñjitvāna sambuddho, pattaṃ dhovitvā yoniso;","thi-ap19:31.3":"Anumodanīyaṃkāsi, nāgakaññā mahiddhikā.","thi-ap19:32.1":"“Sabbaññuṃ phullitaṃ disvā, nāgakaññā mahāyasaṃ;","thi-ap19:32.3":"Pasannaṃ satthuno cittaṃ, sunibandhañca mānasaṃ.","thi-ap19:33.1":"“Mamañca cittamaññāya, jalajuttamanāmako;","thi-ap19:33.3":"Tasmiṃ khaṇe mahāvīro, bhikkhuniṃ dassayiddhiyā.","thi-ap19:34.1":"“Iddhī anekā dassesi, bhikkhunī sā visāradā;","thi-ap19:34.3":"Pamoditā vedajātā, satthāraṃ idamabravi [etadabraviṃ (syā. pī.)].","thi-ap19:35.1":"“‘Addasāhaṃ imaṃ iddhiṃ, sumanaṃ itarāyapi;","thi-ap19:35.3":"Kathaṃ ahosi sā vīra, iddhiyā suvisāradā’.","thi-ap19:36.1":"“‘Orasā mukhato jātā, dhītā mama mahiddhikā;","thi-ap19:36.3":"Mamānusāsanikarā, iddhiyā suvisāradā’.","thi-ap19:37.1":"“Buddhassa vacanaṃ sutvā, evaṃ patthesahaṃ tadā [tuṭṭhā evaṃ avocahaṃ (syā.), evamahosahaṃ tadā (ka.)];","thi-ap19:37.3":"Ahampi tādisā homi, iddhiyā suvisāradā.","thi-ap19:38.1":"“Pamoditāhaṃ sumanā, patthe uttamamānasā [pattauttamamānasā (sī. syā. pī.)];","thi-ap19:38.3":"Anāgatamhi addhāne, īdisā homi nāyaka.","thi-ap19:39.1":"“Maṇimayamhi pallaṅke, maṇḍapamhi pabhassare;","thi-ap19:39.3":"Annapānena tappetvā, sasaṅghaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","thi-ap19:40.1":"“Nāgānaṃ pavaraṃ pupphaṃ, aruṇaṃ nāma uppalaṃ;","thi-ap19:40.3":"Vaṇṇaṃ me īdisaṃ hotu, pūjesiṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","thi-ap19:41.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap19:41.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap19:42.1":"“Tato cutāhaṃ manuje, upapannā sayambhuno;","thi-ap19:42.3":"Uppalehi paṭicchannaṃ, piṇḍapātamadāsahaṃ.","thi-ap19:43.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, vipassī nāma nāyako;","thi-ap19:43.3":"Uppajji cārudassano, sabbadhammesu cakkhumā.","thi-ap19:44.1":"“Seṭṭhidhītā tadā hutvā, bārāṇasipuruttame;","thi-ap19:44.3":"Nimantetvāna sambuddhaṃ, sasaṅghaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","thi-ap19:45.1":"“Mahādānaṃ daditvāna, uppalehi vināyakaṃ;","thi-ap19:45.3":"Pūjayitvā cetasāva [ca teheva (syā. pī.)], vaṇṇasobhaṃ apatthayiṃ.","thi-ap19:46.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","thi-ap19:46.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","thi-ap19:47.1":"“Upaṭṭhāko mahesissa, tadā āsi narissaro;","thi-ap19:47.3":"Kāsirājā kikī nāma, bārāṇasipuruttame.","thi-ap19:48.1":"“Tassāsiṃ dutiyā dhītā, samaṇaguttasavhayā;","thi-ap19:48.3":"Dhammaṃ sutvā jinaggassa, pabbajjaṃ samarocayiṃ.","thi-ap19:49.1":"“Anujāni na no tāto, agāreva tadā mayaṃ;","thi-ap19:49.3":"Vīsavassasahassāni, vicarimha atanditā.","thi-ap19:50.1":"“Komāribrahmacariyaṃ, rājakaññā sukhedhitā;","thi-ap19:50.3":"Buddhopaṭṭhānaniratā, muditā sattadhītaro.","thi-ap19:51.1":"“Samaṇī samaṇaguttā ca, bhikkhunī bhikkhudāyikā [bhikkhudāsikā (sī. syā.)];","thi-ap19:51.3":"Dhammā ceva sudhammā ca, sattamī saṅghadāyikā [saṃghadāsikā (sī. syā.)].","thi-ap19:52.1":"“Ahaṃ khemā ca sappaññā, paṭācārā ca kuṇḍalā;","thi-ap19:52.3":"Kisāgotamī dhammadinnā, visākhā hoti sattamī.","thi-ap19:53.1":"“Tehi kammehi sukatehi, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap19:53.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap19:54.1":"“Tato cutā manussesu, upapannā mahākule;","thi-ap19:54.3":"Pītaṃ maṭṭhaṃ varaṃ dussaṃ, adaṃ arahato ahaṃ.","thi-ap19:55.1":"“Tato cutāriṭṭhapure, jātā vippakule ahaṃ;","thi-ap19:55.3":"Dhītā tiriṭivacchassa, ummādantī manoharā.","thi-ap19:56.1":"“Tato cutā janapade, kule aññatare ahaṃ;","thi-ap19:56.3":"Pasūtā nātiphītamhi, sāliṃ gopemahaṃ tadā.","thi-ap19:57.1":"“Disvā paccekasambuddhaṃ, pañcalājāsatānihaṃ;","thi-ap19:57.3":"Datvā padumacchannāni, pañca puttasatānihaṃ.","thi-ap19:58.1":"“Patthayiṃ tepi patthesuṃ, madhuṃ datvā sayambhuno;","thi-ap19:58.3":"Tato cutā araññehaṃ, ajāyiṃ padumodare.","thi-ap19:59.1":"“Kāsirañño mahesīhaṃ, hutvā sakkatapūjitā;","thi-ap19:59.3":"Ajaniṃ rājaputtānaṃ, anūnaṃ satapañcakaṃ.","thi-ap19:60.1":"“Yadā te yobbanappattā, kīḷantā jalakīḷitaṃ;","thi-ap19:60.3":"Disvā opattapadumaṃ, āsuṃ paccekanāyakā.","thi-ap19:61.1":"“Sāhaṃ tehi vinābhūtā, sutavīrehi sokinī [sutavarehi sokinī (sī. syā.)];","thi-ap19:61.3":"Cutā isigilipasse, gāmakamhi ajāyihaṃ.","thi-ap19:62.1":"“Yadā buddhā sutamatī, sutānaṃ bhattunopi ca [kasataṃ tadā (sī.), attanopi ca (syā.)];","thi-ap19:62.3":"Yāguṃ ādāya gacchantī, aṭṭha paccekanāyake.","thi-ap19:63.1":"“Bhikkhāya gāmaṃ gacchante, disvā putte anussariṃ;","thi-ap19:63.3":"Khīradhārā viniggacchi, tadā me puttapemasā.","thi-ap19:64.1":"“Tato tesaṃ adaṃ yāguṃ, pasannā sehi pāṇibhi;","thi-ap19:64.3":"Tato cutāhaṃ tidasaṃ, nandanaṃ upapajjahaṃ.","thi-ap19:65.1":"“Anubhotvā sukhaṃ dukkhaṃ, saṃsaritvā bhavābhave;","thi-ap19:65.3":"Tavatthāya mahāvīra, pariccattañca jīvitaṃ.","thi-ap19:66.1":"“Evaṃ bahuvidhaṃ dukkhaṃ, sampattī ca bahubbidhā;","thi-ap19:66.3":"Pacchime bhave sampatte, jātā sāvatthiyaṃ pure.","thi-ap19:67.1":"“Mahādhanaseṭṭhikule, sukhite sajjite tathā;","thi-ap19:67.3":"Nānāratanapajjote, sabbakāmasamiddhine.","thi-ap19:68.1":"“Sakkatā pūjitā ceva, mānitāpacitā tathā;","thi-ap19:68.3":"Rūpasīrimanuppattā [rūpasobhaggasampannā (sī.)], kulesu atisakkatā [abhisammatā (sī.)].","thi-ap19:69.1":"“Atīva patthitā cāsiṃ, rūpabhogasirīhi ca;","thi-ap19:69.3":"Patthitā seṭṭhiputtehi, anekehi satehipi.","thi-ap19:70.1":"“Agāraṃ pajahitvāna, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap19:70.3":"Aḍḍhamāse asampatte, catusaccamapāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap19:71.1":"“Iddhiyā abhinimmitvā, caturassaṃ rathaṃ ahaṃ;","thi-ap19:71.3":"Buddhassa pāde vandissaṃ, lokanāthassa tādino.","thi-ap19:72.1":"“‘Supupphitaggaṃ upagamma pādapaṃ [bhikkhunī (sī. pī. ka.) therīgā.230], ekā tuvaṃ tiṭṭhasi sālamūle;","thi-ap19:72.3":"Na cāpi te dutiyo atthi koci [na catthi te dutiyā vaṇṇadhātu (sī. pī. ka.)], bāle na tvaṃ bhāyasi dhuttakānaṃ’.","thi-ap19:73.1":"“‘Sataṃ sahassānipi dhuttakānaṃ [sahassānampi dhuttakānaṃ (pī.) therīgā.231], samāgatā edisakā bhaveyyuṃ;","thi-ap19:73.3":"Lomaṃ na iñje na sampavedhe, kiṃ me tuvaṃ māra karissaseko [na māra bhāyāmi tavekikāpi (sī. ka.)… tamekikāsiṃ (pī.)].","thi-ap19:74.1":"“‘Esā antaradhāyāmi, kucchiṃ vā pavisāmi te;","thi-ap19:74.3":"Bhamukantarikāyampi, tiṭṭhantiṃ maṃ na dakkhasi.","thi-ap19:75.1":"“‘Cittasmiṃ vasībhūtāmhi, iddhipādā subhāvitā;","thi-ap19:75.3":"Sabbabandhanamuttāmhi, na taṃ bhāyāmi āvuso.","thi-ap19:76.1":"“‘Sattisūlūpamā kāmā, khandhāsaṃ adhikuṭṭanā;","thi-ap19:76.3":"Yaṃ tvaṃ kāmaratiṃ brūsi, aratī dāni sā mama.","thi-ap19:77.1":"“‘Sabbattha vihatā nandī, tamokhandho padālito;","thi-ap19:77.3":"Evaṃ jānāhi pāpima, nihato tvamasi antaka’.","thi-ap19:78.1":"“Jino tamhi guṇe tuṭṭho, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ;","thi-ap19:78.3":"Aggā iddhimatīnanti, parisāsu vināyako.","thi-ap19:79.1":"“Pariciṇṇo mayā satthā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ;","thi-ap19:79.3":"Ohito garuko bhāro, bhavanetti samūhatā.","thi-ap19:80.1":"“Yassatthāya pabbajitā, agārasmānagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap19:80.3":"So me attho anuppatto, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayo.","thi-ap19:81.1":"“Cīvaraṃ piṇḍapātañca, paccayaṃ sayanāsanaṃ;","thi-ap19:81.3":"Khaṇena upanāmenti, sahassāni samantato.","thi-ap19:82.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā;","thi-ap19:83.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap19:84.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap19:85.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ uppalavaṇṇā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap19:86.1":"Uppalavaṇṇātheriyāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
